    {
      "id": "26b2dc6f-ea04-454d-a5cb-1fd35a867053",
      "name": "Incident Assessment Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        4224,
        1776
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Property: {{ $('Prepare Incident Details').item.json.property }}\nReported issue: {{ $('Prepare Incident Details').item.json.reported_issue }}\n\nLook at the attached site photo and the reported issue.\n\nRespond in the exact JSON shape defined by the output schema \u2014 nothing more. Keep every field short:\n- category: one or two words (e.g. PROPERTY_DAMAGE, PPE_VIOLATION, ELECTRICAL, STRUCTURAL, HOUSEKEEPING)\n- severity: LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH\n- urgency: NORMAL or URGENT\n- summary: ONE sentence, plain language, describing what's actually visible\n- action: ONE sentence, the single next step\n\nOnly describe what you can actually see in the photo. Do not list hazards you cannot confirm. No extra commentary, no markdown, no bullet lists.",
        "options": {
          "passthroughBinaryPdfs": true
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
